# BoatPhone credentials template. Copy to `.env` and fill in; `.env` is gitignored.
# Never commit a real token. Process environment variables override this file.
#
# ONC Oceans 3.0 API token -- register / retrieve at https://data.oceannetworks.ca
# (Profile -> Web Services API). The value below is a placeholder, not a token.
ONC_TOKEN=your-onc-token-here
